{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2516,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "com.c11.spt22lr",
  "name": ".22lr Ammunition",
  "slug": "22lr-ammunition",
  "teaser": "Adds the most popular round in the world to the end of the world.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/nqZEyiJKm4ae4dYSSHaNIDr0k5Bp4jskAMgm1bSF.jpg",
  "downloads": 21365,
  "favourites_count": 47,
  "description": "<p>Introducing the most popular round around to the world of Tarkov!</p>\n<p>The guns that use this ammo are currently all in my True North mod.</p>\n<p>This mod adds the ‘versatile’ and widely-loved (or hated) .22 Long Rifle calibre.</p>\n<p>Perfect for quiet Scav elimination, annoying PMC’s with any armor at all, and for when you completely run out of money and you need something that technically goes bang.</p>\n<p>This pack serves as a foundational ammunition library, designed to be expanded upon by other weapon modders in the community.\nFeatures:</p>\n<p>This mod includes a few ammunition types, with more to come:</p>\n<p>-CCI .22 LR Standard Velocity,</p>\n<p>-CCI Stinger .22LR Copper Hollowpoint</p>\n<p>-CCI 22 LR Shotshell #12 Shot</p>\n<p>-Piney Mountain .22LR Tracer</p>\n<p>-Lapua SK Standard Plus</p>\n<p>-Eley Sport</p>\n<p>-Eley Tenex Biathlon</p>\n<p>-CCI Hyperspeed</p>\n<p>A Note for Mod Authors:</p>\n<p>If you’d like to add .22 to any of your mods:</p>\n<p>Add this mod as a hard dependency in your own project’s metadata.</p>\n<p>Reference the item IDs for the ammunition directly in your weapon or magazine files.</p>\n<p>Please do not repackage, integrate, or bundle the files from this mod with your own.</p>\n<p>If you’d like to create more round types, please send them over to me and I will integrate them and give credit, or create an addon for this mod.</p>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2516/22lr-ammunition",
